# 7. Complete presentations

The previous examples place one model in one slide. In a talk, the models are mixed with the rest of the
presentation: a title, an outline, sections, slides of text, and from time to time a slide with a model next to
its text. The two presentations below are the same talk of twelve slides, made once with reveal.js and once
with lhtml-site, using the models of the examples.

